      "description": "使用 LightGBM 训练分类模型，通过设置 class_weight='balanced' 自动平衡正负样本权重，适用于类别不平衡的流失预测等场景。",
      "inputs": "X: 特征矩阵 (DataFrame 或 Array-like), y: 目标变量标签 (Series 或 Array-like)",
      "outputs": "model: 训练好的 LGBMClassifier 模型实例",
      "params": {
        "params": null
      },
      "origin": "extracted",
      "executable": false,
      "code": "def train_lgbm_balanced(X, y, params=None):\n    \"\"\"训练类别不平衡场景下的 LightGBM 流失模型。\n\n    经验参数：num_leaves 15~63，learning_rate 0.03~0.1，用 scale_pos_weight\n    或 class_weight=\"balanced\" 处理正负样本约 1:3 的不平衡。\n    \"\"\"\n    default = {\"n_estimators\": 400, \"learning_rate\": 0.05, \"num_leaves\": 31, \"class_weight\": \"balanced\", \"verbose\": -1}\n    model = lgb.LGBMClassifier(**{**default, **(params or {})})\n    model.fit(X, y)\n    return model"
    },
    {
      "id": "Operator:ChargeRatioFeatureGenerator@1",
      "type": "Operator",
      "key": "ChargeRatioFeatureGenerator@1",
      "name": "ChargeRatioFeatureGenerator",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "feature",
      "modalities": [
        "tabular"
      ],
      "description": "构造历史月均消费与当前月费的比值特征，用于衡量用户近期资费变动趋势。",
      "inputs": "包含月消费、总消费和在网时长字段的 DataFrame",
      "outputs": "新增 charge_ratio 特征列的 DataFrame",
      "params": {
        "monthly": "monthly_charges",
        "total": "total_charges",
        "tenure": "tenure"
      },
      "origin": "extracted",
      "executable": false,
      "code": "def add_charge_ratio(df, monthly=\"monthly_charges\", total=\"total_charges\", tenure=\"tenure\"):\n    \"\"\"构造消费相关比值特征：月均消费 / 当前月费，衡量近期资费是否上涨。\n\n    要求 total_charges 已为数值；tenure 为 0 时比值记为 1。\n    \"\"\"\n    out = df.copy()\n    avg = out[total] / out[tenure].replace(0, np.nan)\n    out[\"charge_ratio\"] = (avg / out[monthly]).replace([np.inf, -np.inf], np.nan).fillna(1.0)\n    return out"
    },
    {
      "id": "Operator:IdColumnDropper@1",
      "type": "Operator",
      "key": "IdColumnDropper@1",
      "name": "IdColumnDropper",
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "feature",
      "modalities": [
